{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Project Extreme x Despair is here! &quot;Kazutaka Kodaka&quot; and &quot;Kotaro Uchikoshi&quot; comes a brand-new adventure game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Takumi Sumino is a totally average teenager living in the Tokyo Residential Complex, a place where every day is much like the last and nothing bad ever happens. All that changes when freakish monsters attack the town and start wreaking havoc. A strange creature calling himself Sirei appears and offers Takumi the power to protect those he holds dear... All he has to do is stab himself in the chest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The next thing he knows, Takumi is in Last Defense Academy, a school in the middle of nowhere surrounded by a wall of otherworldly flames. He and 14 other students have been drafted into the Special Defense Unit, a team tasked with keeping the school safe for the next 100 days. How much are they willing to sacrifice to take back their normal lives and save the world from the grotesque school invaders?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The curtain rises on 100 days of war and despair...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014080/extras/76fb0e55613750e408d1b813e20ff045.poster.avif?t=1763608121\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014080/extras/76fb0e55613750e408d1b813e20ff045.webm?t=1763608121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014080/extras/76fb0e55613750e408d1b813e20ff045.mp4?t=1763608121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extreme Despair-Filled Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Takumi's choices will decide his future, but there's no telling what kind of consequences these decisions might have...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014080/extras/9fcd5b674cad8cf8513f35b5704deeb9.poster.avif?t=1763608121\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014080/extras/9fcd5b674cad8cf8513f35b5704deeb9.webm?t=1763608121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014080/extras/9fcd5b674cad8cf8513f35b5704deeb9.mp4?t=1763608121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defensive Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the invaders attack, it's up to you to protect the school in SRPG battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use each student's unique Specialist Skills to turn the tide of battle in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014080/extras/1a3daaf2747fc4b8e0550157f0c11cb1.poster.avif?t=1763608121\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014080/extras/1a3daaf2747fc4b8e0550157f0c11cb1.webm?t=1763608121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014080/extras/1a3daaf2747fc4b8e0550157f0c11cb1.mp4?t=1763608121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Free Time &amp; Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend time with your teammates to deepen your bonds, or explore the wilderness and ruins outside the school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even use the items you find to craft gifts and get even closer to your allies!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\"Extreme\" and \"Despair\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014080/563576e1feece5ce16e9772c1422fe71eb774b24.jpg"},{"name":"The End of Your Peaceful Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014080/b515cdcff7d71a842091a06800155c1fff36fbfb.jpg"},{"name":"Extermination Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014080/84adc4d92d8e4bec4e324b0350566ec3ac2e5b42.jpg"},{"name":"Listen to Me!!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014080/12821cbc863f7795af60093969f04a0278627e0e.jpg"},{"name":"The Other Academy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014080/ffb84fb5f794a4bb94e292a4183b7d985e4d743a.jpg"},{"name":"Special Defense Unit, Fight!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014080/5ebacc0f0c7d2a39e4fc3355a68ab1b8f3e5dd4f.jpg"},{"name":"Rock 'n' Roll Academy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014080/f1868266a334385ad80ff5c12766da30dce182b7.jpg"},{"name":"Confidential","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014080/d0035f2fa997b5bf7950dd9d556cc0c8691a7246.jpg"},{"name":"Ima's Grand Return","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014080/e194d410506504b7d609ab2c1bad76ceb3d26522.jpg"},{"name":"In Memoriam","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014080/6081d6141b815d6bbffebb19cebdfa3848ea3780.jpg"}],"total":47},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3014080?t=1763608121","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014080/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763608121","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014080/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763608121","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014080/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763608121","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Blood & gore, Intense Violence, Partial Nudity, Strong Language."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3386470,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014080/extras/c42cdccdf8c098e64568f1d9bb083586.avif?t=1763608121\" width=616 height=306 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDigital Deluxe Edition\u201d with original soundtrack and art book will be available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Preorder Bonuses</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers who preorder the game will receive the following bonus content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Digital Novel &quot;Former Lives of the Special Defense Unit: File 03 - Hiruko Shizuhara's First Battle&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exclusive look at Hiruko Shizuhara's life in the Tokyo Residential Complex before the start of the game, giving fresh insight into this character's backstory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The novel contains no spoilers and can be read before or after finishing the main game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Preorder bonuses are only valid for orders placed before the release date.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The digital novel is treated as a separate application from the base game. It cannot be launched from within the game itself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Project Extreme x Despair is here! &quot;Kazutaka Kodaka&quot; and &quot;Kotaro Uchikoshi&quot; comes a brand-new adventure game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Takumi Sumino is a totally average teenager living in the Tokyo Residential Complex, a place where every day is much like the last and nothing bad ever happens. All that changes when freakish monsters attack the town and start wreaking havoc. A strange creature calling himself Sirei appears and offers Takumi the power to protect those he holds dear... All he has to do is stab himself in the chest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The next thing he knows, Takumi is in Last Defense Academy, a school in the middle of nowhere surrounded by a wall of otherworldly flames. He and 14 other students have been drafted into the Special Defense Unit, a team tasked with keeping the school safe for the next 100 days. How much are they willing to sacrifice to take back their normal lives and save the world from the grotesque school invaders?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The curtain rises on 100 days of war and despair...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014080/extras/76fb0e55613750e408d1b813e20ff045.poster.avif?t=1763608121\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014080/extras/76fb0e55613750e408d1b813e20ff045.webm?t=1763608121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014080/extras/76fb0e55613750e408d1b813e20ff045.mp4?t=1763608121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extreme Despair-Filled Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Takumi's choices will decide his future, but there's no telling what kind of consequences these decisions might have...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014080/extras/9fcd5b674cad8cf8513f35b5704deeb9.poster.avif?t=1763608121\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014080/extras/9fcd5b674cad8cf8513f35b5704deeb9.webm?t=1763608121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014080/extras/9fcd5b674cad8cf8513f35b5704deeb9.mp4?t=1763608121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defensive Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the invaders attack, it's up to you to protect the school in SRPG battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use each student's unique Specialist Skills to turn the tide of battle in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014080/extras/1a3daaf2747fc4b8e0550157f0c11cb1.poster.avif?t=1763608121\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014080/extras/1a3daaf2747fc4b8e0550157f0c11cb1.webm?t=1763608121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014080/extras/1a3daaf2747fc4b8e0550157f0c11cb1.mp4?t=1763608121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Free Time &amp; Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend time with your teammates to deepen your bonds, or explore the wilderness and ruins outside the school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even use the items you find to craft gifts and get even closer to your allies!</p>","developers":["Too Kyo Games","Media.Vision Inc."],"dlc":[3313470,3319760],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014080/header.jpg?t=1763608121","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9Aniplex, TooKyo Games","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"metacritic":{"score":83,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/the-hundred-line-last-defense-academy?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3014080/930971540/189c75f48e775c2ef8f834e07df5323d674cb456/1750822962/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748443545","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3014080/930971540/189c75f48e775c2ef8f834e07df5323d674cb456/1750822962/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748443545","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3014080/930971540/189c75f48e775c2ef8f834e07df5323d674cb456/1750822962/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748443545","id":257146994,"name":"Accolade Trailer_EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257146994/4c2626959209ea7dac3655be151c221c8816485f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748443545"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3014080/881553/a913060ab37d568930f39bdcafbe7f2b388351e9/1750822961/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746005993","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.co